---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
const base='/equipment/11-10/';
---
<Layout pageTitle="Custom microLED fixture concept · closed original shell" description="Explore an original unbuilt fixture exterior and a physically separate passive series-circuit drawing." wide={true}>
<article class="equipment mt"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/11-10/">← Equipment 11-10</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#mt-evidence">Evidence and assumptions</a></nav>
<header class="eq-mast"><span class="eq-meta">11-10 · ORIGINAL CONCEPT & DETACHED CIRCUIT CARD / FIRST PASS</span><h2>Custom microLED fixture concept</h2><p>Orbit an original unbuilt fixture silhouette. On the unrelated teaching monitor, compare two ideal series circuit drawings. One has a continuous path and the other has a gap. The fixture has no control or active hardware.</p></header>
<div class="grid"><section><h3>Original inactive geometry</h3><div id="mt-view" aria-label="Orbitable original fixture base and covered exterior with a physically separate teaching monitor"></div>
<div class="bar"><button data-mt-view="overall">Reset view</button><button data-mt-view="shell">Concept shell</button><button data-mt-view="display">Detached monitor</button><button id="mt-cycle">Next passive card</button></div>
<p id="mt-ready" role="status">Loading metric model…</p><p>Drag to orbit and pinch or scroll to zoom. The teal badge on the separate monitor switches paper drawings only; the fixture remains unchanged.</p></section>
<section><h3>Detached passive series diagram</h3><canvas id="mt-plot" width="660" height="436" aria-label="Unaffiliated ideal series diagram with labeled resistor placeholders and a normalized reference"></canvas>
<div class="card-ctl"><div class="fields"><label>Fixed card<select id="mt-case"><option value="complete">Continuous ideal series card</option><option value="gap">Card with an ideal open gap</option></select></label></div>
<div class="bar"><button class="primary" id="mt-inspect">Inspect ideal readings</button><button id="mt-reset">Reset</button><button id="mt-json" disabled>Inspection JSON</button></div><p id="mt-status" aria-live="polite">Select a fixed card or inspect the default diagram.</p><output id="mt-result"></output></div></section></div>
<section id="mt-evidence"><h3>Original design assumptions</h3><p>The record calls for a custom fixture but gives no measured equipment, photographs, model or vendor. This first pass is an original nominal design envelope: a 240 × 180 mm footprint, a 115 mm maximum height, and a fixed upper bridge over three solid covers. Outside panel forms and fastener marks are illustrative. There are no built parts, working interfaces, emitters, internal components, or operational alignments. All dimensions are authored design assumptions, not measurements.</p>
<div class="grid"><figure><img width="660" height="440" src={base+'front.webp'} loading="lazy" alt="Original front rendering of the unbuilt fixture and detached monitor"/><figcaption>Original geometry render, not a reference photograph or existing device. The teaching display is a separate object.</figcaption></figure><figure><img width="660" height="440" src={base+'detail.webp'} loading="lazy" alt="Original close-up of the proposed bench fixture cover and permanently closed central recess"/><figcaption>Original close-up showing the nominal staged silhouette and inactive opaque covers.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Independent reference</th><th>Actual / interpretation</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Concept geometry</td><td>240 W × 180 D × 115 H mm initial design</td><td>Metric GLB envelope verified. No claim about buildability or an actual instrument.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Continuous paper diagram</td><td>3.3 kΩ + 6.8 kΩ = 10.1 kΩ; normalized 1 V</td><td>99.009901 µA; drops 0.326733 V and 0.673267 V.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Ideal mathematical gap</td><td>Zero series current; entire reference difference at gap</td><td>0 µA, 0 V across either resistor and 1 V across the gap. Equivalent resistance is null rather than zero.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Original register acceptance</td><td>Emitted and biological-effect calculations</td><td>Not implemented or run. This page has no emission, exposure, specimen, operation or materials workflow.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>Only the detached diagram uses Ohm's law: <code>I = V / (R₁ + R₂)</code> for a continuous ideal series path, and <code>Vᵢ = I Rᵢ</code>. The normalized 1 V is part of the mathematical illustration, not a fixture control or device value. The JSON export stores synthetic IDs, drawing revision, units, and calculated results; it is not a measured device trace.</p>
<p><a href={base+'fixture-concept-static.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={base+'model.py'} download>Editable Blender generator</a> · <a href={base+'card-example.json'}>Output schema example</a> · <a href={base+'verification.json'}>Verification</a> · <a href={base+'xr-manifest.json'}>VR action contract</a>. No headset or live hardware was tested.</p></section>
</article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/11-10/browser.mjs';</script>
<style>
.mt{max-width:76rem}.mt .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.1rem}.mt section{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem 0;margin:.8rem 0;min-width:0}.mt .bar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.44rem;margin:.55rem 0}.mt .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.48rem}.mt label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.2rem;font-size:.92rem}.mt input,.mt select,.mt button{font:inherit;color:var(--text);background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:.14rem;max-width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:2.4em;padding:.32em .52em}.mt button{cursor:pointer}.mt button:disabled{opacity:.52;cursor:default}.mt .primary{color:white;background:#245350}.mt #mt-view{height:clamp(270px,31vw,435px);background:#d9dddf;touch-action:none}.mt #mt-view :global(canvas){width:100%;height:100%;display:block}.mt #mt-plot,.mt img{width:100%;height:auto}.mt #mt-result{display:block;white-space:pre-line;margin:.45rem 0;font:1rem monospace}.mt #mt-status.error{color:#a54a34}.mt .scroll{overflow:auto}.mt table{border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.89rem}.mt td,.mt th{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);text-align:left;padding:.45rem}.mt figure{margin:.8rem 0}@media(max-width:800px){.mt .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
